{"description": "Crisp green lettuce leaves with ruffled edges and pale ribs, moist, arranged on the right side of the plate. Covers about 12% of plate area, thin layered leaves.", "candidates": ["romaine lettuce", "green leaf lettuce", "iceberg lettuce"], "grams": 50},
{"description": "Dark purple-black cubed pieces with grilled char marks and slightly soft, glossy skin, a few pieces scattered near the bottom and right of the protein. Covers about 6% of plate area, cubes about 2 cm.", "candidates": ["grilled eggplant", "grilled zucchini with skin", "roasted beet"], "grams": 45}
